  "configuration": "CMARK_DISABLE_ATTRIBUTES opts out of Apple attributed-string grammar; local CMARK_OPT_NO_FENCED_CODE (bit 22) opts out of fence recognition per render, preserving the original preference. Default native fence behavior is unchanged. Local set_match_inline_before_func is a generic opt-in extension bridge for Swift dialect callbacks; the native engine adjusts multiline positions, with no dialect grammar in C. Local set_source_prefix_func is a generic opt-in native metadata bridge before recognized prefix removal; Swift observes definitions and reconciles positions before native inline parsing. It adds no reference grammar. Local set_block_source_func observes finalized source metadata before native tree transformations; no block grammar is added.",
